{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/057-shuo-ren/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/057-shuo-ren/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1/data.json","title":"毛詩傳箋通釋 · 碩人其頎，衣錦褧衣，齊侯之子，衛侯之妻，東宮之妹，邢侯之姨，譚公維私。手如柔荑，膚如凝脂，領如蝤蠐，齒如瓠犀，螓首蛾眉，巧笑倩兮，美目盼兮。碩人敖敖，說于農郊，四牡有驕，朱幩鑣鑣，翟茀以朝，大夫夙退，無使君勞。河水洋洋，北流活活，施罛濊濊，鱣鮪發發，葭菼揭揭，庶姜孽孽，庶士有朅。 · 马瑞辰 · 通释","description":"風 · 衛風 · 碩人 · 《毛詩傳箋通釋》关于“碩人其頎，衣錦褧衣，齊侯之子，衛侯之妻，東宮之妹…”的注脚：馬瑞辰通釋《碩人》時，以“褧”為婦女障塵蔽文之衣，以“蝤蠐”狀頸白長，以“發發”寫魚著網尾發發然，總以此詩鋪寫莊姜貴盛、美麗與從嫁之備。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"057-shuo-ren","materialId":"maruichen-tongshi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/057-shuo-ren/maruichen-tongshi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"057-shuo-ren","title":"碩人","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"weifeng","path":["風","衛風","碩人"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"碩人其頎","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"衣錦褧衣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"齊侯之子","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"衛侯之妻","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"東宮之妹","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"邢侯之姨","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"譚公維私","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"手如柔荑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"膚如凝脂","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"領如蝤蠐","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"齒如瓠犀","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"螓首蛾眉","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"巧笑倩兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"美目盼兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"碩人敖敖","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"說于農郊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"四牡有驕","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"朱幩鑣鑣","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"翟茀以朝","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"大夫夙退","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"無使君勞","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"河水洋洋","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"北流活活","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"施罛濊濊","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-025","text":"鱣鮪發發","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-026","text":"葭菼揭揭","isA